Four commits from upstream master that v77 does not have, squashed in the
order upstream landed them (git apply reads nothing before the first diff):

  f295474 #1208 Keep the blur alive on the lock screen
  f13bdcf #1211 Blur the app grid behind the overview dash
  5aa509b #1217 Match application blur rules against window titles
  4bbea1f #1218 Keep static application blur still while windows animate

5aa509b's po/blur-my-shell@aunetx.pot hunk is left out: the template is not
packed, and v77's has another date in its header, so it would not apply.

